==Bailang==

===Etymology===
Coblin, reconstructing the Bailang pronunciation as {{m|tbq-blg||*gljung}}, suggests that it derives from {{der-lite|tbq-blg|sit-pro|*kl(j)u(ŋ/k)||river, gorge}} and retains its consonant cluster, which was lost in {{cog|tbq-lob-pro|-}}. Compare {{cog|bo|ལྗོངས}}, {{cog-lite|zh|-}} {{och-l|谷|id=2}}.

